[39m     [38;5;246mverification off anywhere. Needs the cert file path from you.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m verify=False unconditionally
     [38;5;246mWhat you asked for literally: both requests.get calls in client.py get verify=False, which also disables [39m
